# Champion of the Weird: "Pay 1 life, Blight 2: Target opponent blights 2. Activate only as a sorcery" (CR 602.5d, 701.68a). On
# turn 2, in Bot2's main phase, Bot1 can't activate it. On turn 3, in its own main phase with an empty stack, it can: Bot1 pays 1 life
# and blights the Champion, then Bot2 chooses a creature it controls - its Hill Giant, a 3/3 - and puts the two counters on it.

